Of course, the 10-inch pies anchor the menu with 15 specialty[ selections] and a create[-]your-own option[.] Our Chica Bella white[ pizza], layering mozzarella, ricotta, arugula and a pinch of lemon was a great blend of thin, crispy crust and fresh flavor[,] although a little more ample pinch of citrus[ could] have[ added] a[ bit more] pizz[azz.]
[There are also plenty of] appet[izers,] like four huge shrimp, mozzarella and roasted peppers each wrapped with prosciutto and strips of pastry,[ as well] as soups and[ salads.]
The crispy cauliflower salad was big[ enough] for a meal[ in] itself, layering greens with ribbons of carrot, slivers of red onion, slices of hard-cooked egg, a good portion of chopped tomato, a generous crumble of blue cheese and three big cauliflower patties with deeply-bronzed crusts.
Pasta and classic Italian[ dishes] headline the entrees with everything from Alfredo to Putanesca, but[ there are] also[ plenty of] surprises. Unfortunately, the huge bone-in pork chop stuffed with spinach, roasted peppers, bacon and Romano looked mouth-watering smothered in herb gravy and sitting atop a fluffy mountain of mashed potatoes,[ but] upon[ cutting] into it, we were unpleasantly surprised[ that] the[ meat] was raw in the center. To the credit of[ our] extremely friendly waitress, they quickly made right on the mistake and a more well-done version of the delicious[ dish] was at the table in minutes, along with an[ offer] of free dessert to compensate.
We[ decided] Italian Tiram[isu would] an[ appropriate] finale. The soft layers of sponge cake and airy mascarpone[ cream] had a sublime texture, but I would have preferred a heavier hand with the espresso flavor.
Brick & Brew, 27 Route 23,

=== Text #17 ===
> Master Bedroom--Imagine waking up to looking out over the water!
This never gets old.....another gorgeous sunset!
Beach: Beach and sand flats are about 40 feet away.
LOCATION: Enjoy your stay on this beautiful pond located in West Tisbury on the gorgeous island of Martha's Vineyard. Tisbury Great Pond is an exceptional, private, quiet sanctuary away from everything. It is where the surf rolls in across the landscape. The pond offers an abundance of activities and places to explore. When the ''cut'' is open, it is the absolute[ best]. The beach offers numerous sand flats for the young ones to play on[,] the water is extremely warm and shallow, but also has deep places to swim. Then there is surfing available on the ocean side. When the ''cut'' is open, you can ride[ in or out] depending on which way the tide is going......It is magical!! This is the place to reconnect with nature and be totally at peace. While everything else to make your Vineyard vacation wonderful is not far away, when you are here, you are far, far away in your own, off-the-grid world.
Drive down approximately 3 miles on a dirt road, and this will lead you to the house. The house sits on a 3.5 acre parcel on the west side of Middle Point and overlooks Thumb and Deep Bottom Coves. The immediate area is a globally-rare, sand plain, containing grassland and heath which extends out to the barrier beach and the ocean.
The property includes a beach and swimming area on the Pond, where one can pull up and store[ can]oes, kayaks, sailboats,[ (]Sunfish, Laser are available). A[ canoe is available] for exploring the pond and paddling to the barrier beach. To further enhance your stay, sailboats and kayaks[ can] be rented from Winds Up on the Beach Road in Vineyard Haven.
THE HOUSE: The house has (4) four bedrooms and (1[)] full bath. Each[ of] the four bedrooms[ can accommodate 2] people[.] Bedroom[ #1 has] a double[ bed],[ bedroom #2 has] a double[ bed, bedroom] #[3 has] twin[ beds, and bedroom] #[4 has] twin[ beds. But these bedrooms] are unlike anything you have ever seen! Everything is built in, and the overall effect is as if you were on a ship. The twin beds are not one on[ top] of another[, but rather they are] perpendicular to each other, aff[ording] each[ person their own privacy] and space.

